{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_07",
  "title": "亂局",
  "storyCode": "IW-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ca0a0c97b806a1132beca157b70cb4bdf93d29f95c3e0e2ce982461920bbcacc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "07上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......唔。\n頭疼頭疼......何事如此喧嘩......嗯？\n啊......原來是落子聲響，叮叮噹噹。\n棋罷不知人換世，夢醒只道是何年......何年......何年......\n呃......\n......怎麼酒又沒了。\n這都是何苦呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尚塚摸了摸脖子上的膏藥，這是他的習慣。\n十年如一日地挑起扁擔，上山下山，這也是他的習慣。\n取江峰確實很高，很險。高到沒有人煙，險到萬籟俱寂。\n數不清這是在尚蜀看見的第幾個春天，他抬頭遠眺，只見人蹤盡滅的山道那頭，有一個人。\n一個他等了很久的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我們終於還是再見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "方才見過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那時你沒有帶刀，就不算見過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那現在我帶刀來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......話先說明了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道錯不在你。我也知道，那個雨夜，死的不止是我的兒子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你當然知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你收養了他的女兒，她現在怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我打算讓她接我的班。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是打算接鏢局的班，還是像你這些年做的，安安分分當個老闆娘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都行，看她喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "找到心上人沒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你活不到看她出嫁的那天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......也許今天我們不用打打殺殺的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不可能，我知道你的為人，你心裡有愧，但我心裡有怨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怨了十年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......所以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你一開始就沒打算今天贏我。酒樓茶館客棧，哪一個不都是為了給你的女兒留條退路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道鏢局是個得罪人的行當。你也知道，如果你不在了，鏢局會是什麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別忘了，你掛刀而去，不守規矩，於情，大家體諒你，可於理，你還是個叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那夜之後，你若是背負著那些罪過，帶領鏢局繼續前行，我又怎麼會叛出鏢局！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我兒走鏢，也是有所覺悟的，我何嘗不知？可你的行為，開客棧開餐廳，難道不是踐踏他們的死嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是你！一蹶不振，逃避過去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊......我是知道的，但咱們話說得有點多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行裕鏢局總鏢頭，問霜客，鄭清鉞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......尚家棍，尚塚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "早春，垂暮，樹影婆娑，落雪如銀。\n一陣風起，一把刀落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你實在是歇息得太久了，鄭清鉞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......未必是我歇息得久了，也許是你爬山爬得太多，步法又精進了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可你這樣的英雄好漢，下半輩子卻註定無法行走，也實在可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......只是刀勢太快，雪光晃眼，被你稍微擦破褲腿，我就無法行走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下一刀，你擋不住。你拿的，畢竟不是家傳的寶棍。只是根破木棍罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——爹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夜兒！？你怎麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你果然是杜遙夜。轉眼間，已經長這麼大了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二位好閒情，天色漸晚，還有空在這......比武練習。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是你。你在這裡做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不瞞尚師傅你說，你腰間那隻盞，是我一朋友托我尋來的。我要找亭子，也和那隻酒盞分不開呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我怕刀劍無眼，二位切磋之間......誤碰了酒盞，得不償失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爹，你這是在做什麼——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......夜兒，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "十年前，行裕鏢局接了一單大鏢。但是路上遭遇暴雨，在荒野上被土匪襲擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了保貨，鄭清鉞放棄了同行的鏢師，十幾個弟兄死於非命，其中有我的兒子，也有你的......親生父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鄭清鉞見死不救。他不僅見死不救，到頭來，他也沒把貨物保住，沒把鏢局名聲保住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "甚至再後來，他對鏢局之落魄視而不見，逃避失敗，你知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在那之後，你的母親也離開了尚蜀，回了老家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "杜遙夜......這些，你當真知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夜兒。這沒你的事，爹這就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就是......尚師傅吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是叛徒尚塚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你以為本小姐是什麼人？一無所知地像個傻子一樣在溫室裡長大到今天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，我親爹親娘的事情，我都知道。鄭老頭這些年做了什麼，怎麼做的，我比你更清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，今天我便是要告訴你們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——鏢局也好酒館也罷，遲早是要姓杜的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "麻煩二老，不要現在給我找麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你要是不讓開，是要吃苦頭的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
