      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你總算是一個想活下去的人了，這樣我們的勝負才有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......尚塚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若是你的兒子在天之靈，知道你今天如此作為，他會高興嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別拿那套話來誆我，他就是活著，站在這兒，他也攔不住他老子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......慎師傅，為何在此？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把那幾人送到山頂，我就下山了。想著遲早會遇到梁大人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁大人不也果真來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "過了許久了，我來近處看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那寧小姐那邊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "察覺到了，或許一早就察覺到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "書房失竊，多半是她的小心思吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......還請梁大人勸勸寧小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其他幾位先不提，那位姓白的老陶工，絕對不能出手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "白天師......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他攥一把天雷灑向人間，就等同司歲台和禮部撕破了臉皮，天師府的一雙腳，也不知道站哪兒好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有勞慎師傅操心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......我就是個船夫，操什麼心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前戍守過幾年北疆，天寒地凍沒事幹，就和袍澤弟兄扯些家國大事，聊著玩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然大家都是一心向炎，不過些許小事上差之毫釐，大沒有必要失之千里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "此乃匹夫之責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是匹夫，梁大人也算匹夫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大地厚廣，萬物自由。普天之下，皆為匹夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......梁大人希望我怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "希望慎師傅保尚蜀太平。如果最後出了什麼岔子......希望慎師傅搶在寧小姐和那五人有所行動之前，先一步息事寧人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有句老話叫作盡人事以待天命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁某人從大炎朝堂之上學來的第一句話，便是“天命在人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
